n style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"解析器阻塞与推测解析\">解析器阻塞与推测解析</h2><p>HTML 解析过程中遇到 <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> 标签时，解析器会<strong>暂停</strong>，等待脚本下载并执行完毕后再继续。这是因为脚本可能通过 <code>document.write()</code> 修改文档流。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Parser as HTML 解析器&#10;    participant Network as 网络线程&#10;    participant JS as JS 引擎&#10;    participant Preload as 预加载扫描器&#10;&#10;    Parser-&gt;&gt;Parser: 解析 HTML...&#10;    Parser-&gt;&gt;Parser: 遇到 script 标签&#10;    Parser-&gt;&gt;Network: 请求 script.js&#10;    Parser-&gt;&gt;Preload: 启动预加载扫描器&#10;    Preload-&gt;&gt;Network: 预加载后续资源 (CSS/JS/图片)&#10;    Network--&gt;&gt;JS: script.js 下载完成&#10;    JS-&gt;&gt;JS: 执行脚本&#10;    JS--&gt;&gt;Parser: 执行完毕&#10;    Parser-&gt;&gt;Parser: 继续解析...\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Parser as HTML 解析器\n    participant Network as 网络线程\n    participant JS as JS 引擎\n    participant Preload as 预加载扫描器\n\n    Parser-&gt;&gt;Parser: 解析 HTML...\n    Parser-&gt;&gt;Parser: 遇到 script 标签\n    Parser-&gt;&gt;Network: 请求 script.js\n    Parser-&gt;&gt;Preload: 启动预加载扫描器\n    Preload-&gt;&gt;Network: 预加载后续资源 (CSS/JS/图片)\n    Network--&gt;&gt;JS: script.js 下载完成\n    JS-&gt;&gt;JS: 执行脚本\n    JS--&gt;&gt;Parser: 执行完毕\n    Parser-&gt;&gt;Parser: 继续解析...</pre><p><strong>推测解析（Speculative Parsing）</strong> 通过预加载扫描器在主解析器暂停时继续扫描后续 HTML，提前发现需要加载的资源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>脚本加载方式</th>\n<th>是否阻塞解析</th>\n<th>执行时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&lt;script&gt;</code></td>\n<td>阻塞</td>\n<td>下载后立即执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;script defer&gt;</code></td>\n<td>不阻塞</td>\n<td>DOMContentLoaded 前按顺序执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;script async&gt;</code></td>\n<td>不阻塞</td>\n<td>下载完成后立即执行（不保证顺序）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;script type=&quot;module&quot;&gt;</code></td>\n<td>不阻塞（默认 defer）</td>\n<td>模块依赖解析完成后执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function createScript(src: string, strategy: &#39;sync&#39; | &#39;async&#39; | &#39;defer&#39; | &#39;module&#39;): HTMLScriptElement {&#10;  const script = document.createElement(&#39;script&#39;);&#10;  script.src = src;&#10;&#10;  switch (strategy) {&#10;    case &#39;async&#39;:&#10;      script.async = true;&#10;      break;&#10;    case &#39;defer&#39;:&#10;      script.defer = true;&#10;      break;&#10;    case &#39;module&#39;:&#10;      script.type = &#39;module&#39;;&#10;      break;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return script;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createScript</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">src</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">strategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span