2E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 推测解析器只负责<strong>发现和预加载</strong>资源，不会执行脚本或构建 DOM。它是浏览器自动进行的优化，开发者无需手动干预。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"domcontentloaded-与-load-事件\">DOMContentLoaded 与 load 事件</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Start[&quot;开始解析 HTML&quot;]&#10;    Start --&gt; Parse[&quot;解析 DOM&quot;]&#10;    Parse --&gt; DCL[&quot;DOMContentLoaded\\n(DOM 树就绪)&quot;]&#10;    DCL --&gt; SubRes[&quot;加载子资源\\n(图片/字体/iframe)&quot;]&#10;    SubRes --&gt; Load[&quot;load\\n(所有资源就绪)&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    Start[\"开始解析 HTML\"]\n    Start --&gt; Parse[\"解析 DOM\"]\n    Parse --&gt; DCL[\"DOMContentLoaded\\n(DOM 树就绪)\"]\n    DCL --&gt; SubRes[\"加载子资源\\n(图片/字体/iframe)\"]\n    SubRes --&gt; Load[\"load\\n(所有资源就绪)\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>常见用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>DOMContentLoaded</code></td>\n<td>DOM 树构建完成（不等待样式表、图片）</td>\n<td>初始化 JS、绑定事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>load</code></td>\n<td>所有资源（图片、样式表、iframe）加载完成</td>\n<td>启动依赖图片尺寸的逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>beforeunload</code></td>\n<td>页面即将卸载</td>\n<td>提示用户保存未提交数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>unload</code></td>\n<td>页面正在卸载</td>\n<td>发送统计数据（推荐用 sendBeacon）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"document.addEventListener(&#39;DOMContentLoaded&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;DOM ready&#39;);&#10;  const app = document.getElementById(&#39;app&#39;);&#10;  console.log(&#39;App element:&#39;, app);&#10;});&#10;&#10;window.addEventListener(&#39;load&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;All resources loaded&#39;);&#10;  const images = document.querySelectorAll(&#39;img&#39;);&#10;  for (const img of images) {&#10;    console.log(`${img.src}: ${img.naturalWidth}x${img.naturalHeight}`);&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;&#10;const readyState = document.readyState;&#10;if (readyState === &#39;loading&#39;) {&#10;  document.addEventListener(&#39;DOMContentLoaded&#39;, init);&#10;} else {&#10;  init();&#10;}&#10;&#10;function init(): void {&#10;  console.log(&#39;Initializing...&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DOMContentLoaded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DOM ready'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getElementById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--s